{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>三姐蕭秀香教大家烹調「臭豆蕎頭粉絲蝦煲」。這道菜式選用臭豆、蕎頭、肉碎及浸軟的粉絲，並將中蝦分為未去殼及去殼醃製兩部分煎熟，再配合蝦湯、多款配菜及調味料一同煮勻，做法簡單清晰，大家快來試做吧！</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"5af9a56a-a956-4349-a0ee-93a79ef4838e.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20266sXajcsSD01795771693.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p></p><p><strong>臭豆蕎頭粉絲蝦煲｜材料及調味</strong></p><p><strong>材料：</strong></p><ul><li><p>臭豆 2兩</p></li><li><p>蕎頭 6粒</p></li><li><p>粉絲 4兩（浸凍水）</p></li><li><p>中蝦 8隻</p></li><li><p>肉碎 2兩</p></li><li><p>紅椒絲 1隻</p></li><li><p>芫荽 1紮</p></li><li><p>香葉 少許</p></li><li><p>蒜粒 適量</p></li><li><p>蝦湯 適量</p></li><li><p>薑粒（爆香用）</p></li><li><p>鹽、胡椒粉、蛋白、生粉（醃蝦用）</p></li></ul><p><strong>調味：</strong></p><ul><li><p>蝦醬 2茶匙</p></li><li><p>蠔油 1茶匙</p></li><li><p>生抽 1湯匙</p></li><li><p>老抽 適量</p></li></ul><p><strong>臭豆蕎頭粉絲蝦煲｜做法</strong></p><ol><li><p><strong>醃製去殼中蝦：</strong> 從8隻中蝦中取出6隻去殼，加入鹽、胡椒粉、蛋白及生粉拌勻備用（其餘中蝦保留原殼）。</p></li><li><p><strong>爆香配料及煮粉絲：</strong> 起油鍋爆香薑粒及肉碎，放入臭豆略炒後，加入已浸凍水的粉絲及適量蝦湯兜炒均勻，再注入生抽、蠔油及老抽煮勻，隨即關火備用。</p></li><li><p><strong>煎熟兩種中蝦：</strong> 另起油鍋，先放入未去殼的中蝦煎熟，再放入已去殼的蝦煎熟。</p></li><li><p><strong>混合配菜上碟：</strong> 將煎熟的蝦轉移到粉絲鍋內，重新開火兜勻，最後加入其他配菜一同兜勻即可上碟。</p></li></ol><p><p><img alt=\"c4155df2-3b89-49e5-bda5-d17311574c88.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026XvbZFWnRUX1795771692.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"899f98c0-b189-439d-9780-fbf8f09f494e.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026yN5oe29Aru1795771693.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T10:37:45.053312+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":452,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T09:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T14:53:25.669822+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T10:30:43.821454+00:00","content_hash":"d857e1c4f6cd18f91da3fa403372a1a3d97970b94ff3e9edafa7b2800d68cad5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-28T10:37:45.053312+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}